    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0132" n="12" xml:id="pg12"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister O’Brien to
                        the Acting Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 8.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 7 of the third
                        instant,<anchor n="a" xml:id="d27-f1"/> I now desire to add that on the 4th
                    instant I received a note from Count Raben-Levetzau, minister for foreign
                    affairs, dated the second instant, and being his reply to my telegram advising
                    him of the death of Mr. Hay.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. J. O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d27-a1.xml" xpointer="d27-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
